  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="36630fca-0184-523c-8e8b-5e06cdd4142b" activityNameId="ac5a35cb-2250-5216-9eac-87283720ea82" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at cogen with biogas engine, agricultural covered, allocation exergy</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at cogen with biogas engine, agricultural covered, allocation exergy
The multioutput process "biogas, agriculture covered, in cogen with biogas engine" delivers the co-products: heat "heat, at cogen with biogas engine, agricultural covered, allocation exergy" and electricity "electricity, at cogen with biogas engine, agricultural covered, alloc. Exergy". The allocation is based on the exergy values of heat and electricity. The exergy value of electricity is 1, and the exergy value of heat is 0.17.  The degrees of efficiency are as follows: electricity: 33% and heat: 67%, but in these plants only half of the heat is used or sold (32%). ;
UUID: 2c089e30-1b8b-3071-91d5-da32372dbfaa
Use of biogas in a cogeneration unit. Included are emissions to air, biogas consumption, use and disposal of operational supplements as well as infrastructure expenditures.
Location: Conditions of cogeneration in Switzerland.
Technology: Lambda 1-engine" with a catalytic converter
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 15.1 GWh electricity in this type of plant
Sampling: field data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2c089e30-1b8b-3071-91d5-da32372dbfaa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
